# Portion

An estimate computed as a fraction of another value.

◇

subclass_of_key: method

attributes:
    - key: portion_portion
      name: Portion Portion
      details: Fraction of the original value, from 0 to 1.
      rules: "[0 .. 1] at 0.01 fraction"
      type_spec: Real
    - key: portion_mean
      name: Portion Mean
      details: Middle of the portion bell curve.
      rules: "[unconstrained .. unconstrained] at 0.01 unit"
      type_spec: Real
    - key: portion_variance
      name: Portion Variance
      details: Shape of the portion bell curve.
      rules: "[0 .. unconstrained] at 0.01 unit"
      type_spec: Real
